                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Julie and I had a great time visiting @paws4ph in Anchorage, a program offering support animals for #veterans and service members suffering from post-traumatic stress and other mental health challenges. \n\nThank you, Debbie and Melissa, for training these wonderful Labrador companions, and for your dedication to serving those who\u2019ve sacrificed so much for all of us. #PawsforPurpleHearts",
