                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 21,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019ve heard from so many parents across Alaska concerned about the state of our kids\u2019 mental health and the role social media use is playing. \n\nAlaska Children's Trust recently hosted a roundtable discussion on this crisis, bringing together the perspectives of educators, school administrators, law enforcement officials, youth mental health specialists, and other experts. \n\nWe\u2019ve achieved some important progress on the federal level, particularly the Senate\u2019s overwhelming passage of the Kids Online Safety and Privacy Act, but there\u2019s a lot more to do. I want to thank Trevor, ACT, and all of the Alaskans who took part in this productive discussion.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1729980579,
                "view_count": 2410
            },
