                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I worked relentlessly to make sure the OBBB is full of wins for Alaska\u2014strengthening rural health care, investing in Arctic defense, flexibility on Medicaid/SNAP work requirements, protecting our vulnerable communities, and unleashing Alaskan energy. Alaska has unique challenges, but we are also uniquely positioned to help America.",
