                "text": "The CCP must release Jimmy Lai\u2014a 77-year-old UK citizen and journalist\u2014who\u2019s spent 5 years in a windowless, airless cell for exposing CCP repression in Hong Kong. \n\nHis health is failing. His only \u201ccrime\u201d is telling the truth.",
