                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019ve long advocated for getting pharmaceutical companies to charge Americans the same prices for drugs that they charge other industrial democracies in Europe, Canada & Asia. I applaud the administration\u2019s focus on lowering drug prices and taking bold steps to make health care more affordable for Americans across the board.",
